rows.en:
Well, time for me to go into the club room.
I wonder if {a}'s mad at me...
First things first, a knock...{p}

Knock knock.
"Sorry I'm late!
It's Taguchi, the first-year!"{p}

"So you are the seventh one after all.
Honestly, Hino has such a nasty streak.
He even set up a prank like this."{p}

Geez... what do I have to say to make them believe me?
Hmm, something from my time that doesn't exist here...
...I've got it!☆{p}

I smiled back, not to be outdone.
A devil's smile.
The two of us drained our glasses in one gulp.{p}
